OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy showers in the morning,
OL,6,Fgradually fading, with a few brighter
OL,7,Fand drier spells later. Another stormy
OL,8,Fday, with gales affecting many places
OL,9,Fand very strong gusts at times. The
OL,10,Fwind gradually eases by the evening,
OL,11,Fbut it remains breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBlustery showers and clear
OL,14,Fspells at first, with cloud increasing
OL,15,Fduring the second half of the night
OL,16,Fbut remaining dry. The wind gradually
OL,17,Feases to a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
