OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy, with rain moving in
OL,6,Ffrom the southwest. The rain clears
OL,7,Fmost places by the evening. The wind
OL,8,Fstrengthens by the afternoon,
OL,9,Fespecially over the Pennines.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FRemaining breezy, with showers on
OL,13,FTuesday. Dry but windy on Wednesday.
OL,14,FTurning increasingly settled, with
OL,15,Flighter winds by Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
